{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV09directoryC2Dn7groupIDACSS_SStcfc","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"directoryGroupDn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"init","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"groupID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)":{"title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"groupID","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"who names a group ","type":"text"},{"code":"admins","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"text":" are the same row.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redundant.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"GroupMapping","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"}}}